      "english": "I watched a drama on TV yesterday.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "22793_miru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{歌舞伎|かぶき}を{観|み}るのは{初|はじ}めてだったので、とても{感動|かんどう}した。",
      "english": "It was my first time watching kabuki, so I was very moved.",
